line\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4StarRefinement}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4StarRefinement}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}star\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4StarRefinement}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\\land \\forall V\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\mathcal V:W\\cap V\\neq\\emptyset\\}\\subseteq U\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}star\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4StarRefinement}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\\land \\forall V\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\mathcal V:W\\cap V\\neq\\emptyset\\}\\subseteq U\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccce769ac62de4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccce769ac62de4b","anchor":